  "body": "The changelog says:\r\n\r\n> Remove account data (including client config, push rules and ignored users) upon user deactivation. (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/11655)\r\n\r\nThis was because the PR was meant to be batched with https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/11621 and others, but it missed the cut-off for 1.52.0. We should reword the entry before we release 1.53.0 proper.\r\n\r\nMarking as a release blocker so we don't forget, but can be done as part of the release process.",
